# Normalise text to LF in the repository, so a Windows clone does not commit CRLF
# back and show every line of every file as changed to anyone on Linux or macOS.
* text=auto eol=lf

# ...except the batch files, which MUST stay CRLF on checkout. cmd.exe parses a
# .bat by byte offset, and an LF-only one misreads mid-line: `copy` becomes `opy`,
# `REM` becomes `EM`, and the build dies with "'opy' is not recognized". This is
# not cosmetic — it silently breaks build.bat and package-windows.bat.
*.bat text eol=crlf

# Vendored dependencies. Marked binary so git never tries to diff or convert them.
*.jar binary
*.msi binary
